#~ msgid ""
#~ "`lazy-kb-wiki` takes the third path. The pipeline is six verbs exposed "
#~ "as CLI subcommands — `init`, `import`, `ingest`, `verify`, `build`, `status`"
#~ " — and one orchestrating type: `Pipeline`. This chapter walks the hot path."
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**No network dependency in the default build.** A brand-new `wiki-cli` "
#~ "binary ingests files using the heuristic classifier; there is no \"sorry, "
#~ "your OpenAI key expired\" failure mode."
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "$ wiki-cli --wiki-dir=./demo init kb\n"
#~ msgstr ""

